\title{tvhte: Time-Varying Heterogeneous Treatment Effects in Event Studies}
\description{
Two-step semiparametric estimator for event studies with persistent outcomes and unit-level heterogeneous, dynamic treatment effects, following Botosaru and Liu (2025). Imposes an autoregressive structure on event-time effects to keep dimensionality manageable. First step: quasi-maximum-likelihood for common parameters under a Gaussian working assumption on the random coefficients. Second step: empirical Bayes (Tweedie / Gaussian conjugacy) for unit-specific treatment trajectories. A separate option implements the homogeneous feedback extension of Botosaru and Liu (2026), which decomposes dynamic responses into direct and indirect (covariate-adjustment) components.
}
